  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: e76e338515979f349b7c34409a20ace8, type: 2}
  emptyPositionMemo: Nobody was hired today, so Dale tried to do the job himself.
    It went about as well as you'd expect. We'd rather not talk about it. Please
    hire someone next time.
  emptyPositionPerformance: -1
  endings:
  - minScore: 9
    title: The Synergix Tower
    text: 'You hired a legendary team. Synergix is now the tallest building in the
      city. There''s a helipad. There''s a smoothie bar. There''s a statue of you
      in the lobby, and only one raccoon lives in it.


      Dale cries every morning,
      but they''re happy tears. You''ve been promoted to Supreme Hiring Overlord.'
  - minScore: 4
    title: Steady Growth
    text: 'Synergix is doing well. The office got new chairs, the coffee machine
      works, and the stock price went up a little. Nobody writes songs about it,
      but nobody gets sued either.


      Dale gives you a thumbs up every morning.
      It''s a little weird.'
  - minScore: -1
    title: Business as Usual
    text: 'Synergix survived. Barely. The printer still doesn''t work, the logo is
      still sometimes a duck, and Dale has started a ''Hope Jar''. It has two dollars
      in it.


      You still have your job. For now.'
  - minScore: -6
    title: The Dilapidated Office
    text: 'The roof leaks, the lights flicker, and the big ''SYNERGIX'' sign now
      just says ''S NE GIX''. Dale works from his car.


      HR has asked you to
      ''take a break from hiring''. Forever.'
  - minScore: -999
    title: Spirit Halloween
    text: 'Synergix Global Solutions has gone out of business. The building is now
      a Spirit Halloween.


      Dale works there. He''s very good at it, which
      somehow makes it worse.'
